        "insight_type": "recommendation",
        "position_hint": 0.5,
        "routing_tag": "surface",
        "salience": 0.7667,
        "text": "And the economy is a system, not a set of levers. Pull one and three others move. When we back-tested the calls, the misses were always someone treating a correlated system as if the parts were ind\u2026",
