        "char_start": 812,
        "episode_id": "ep-362f5d463b877d2c",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "So the same discipline Elena talks about in sustainability.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p07_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:cfa8b4256dbedd10",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 1063,
        "char_start": 889,
        "episode_id": "ep-362f5d463b877d2c",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Exactly the same. A macro book and a power grid are both systems of correlated risk. Systems thinking and risk management are one discipline \u2014 you just change the vocabulary.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 48000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 42000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p07_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
